# WRSRE legacy Cline entry point

Read `AGENTS.md` first and follow its lazy load map. The maintained contracts are
`docs/workflow/EXECUTION.md`, `docs/workflow/REVIEW.md`, `INSTRUCTIONS.md` and
the relevant sections of `KILO_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md`; this file does not duplicate
them or expand the user's task authorization.

Check the actual working directory, branch, host, shell and tool availability.
Historical Windows paths, installed software and Ghidra access are not promises
about the current environment. Preserve existing changes, serialize Ghidra
access, and verify consequential findings against accessible raw artifacts.
Missing evidence is a precise blocker, not a reason to guess or restart work.
Research/audit-only tasks stay read-only; live game tests, deployment, Kilo
configuration/model changes and Git publication require separate explicit
authorization.
